# GLOBAL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES

## Optional custom URL path, no trailing slash (default shown)
### Example nested install: app at /careerchive
### Local + Vercel/deployment
NEXT_PUBLIC_CAREERCHIVE_PATH=/

# FLAGS
## Local + Vercel/deployment + GitHub secrets (same names)
### App-level username + password gate. false = local, no login.
FLAG_PRIVATE=false
### Gates in-app Search chatbot UI. Keyword search can exist without this..
FLAG_CHIVEBOT=false


# SESSION
## Signs the FLAG_PRIVATE cookie and encrypts the Settings password copy
### Local + Vercel/deployment + GitHub secrets
SESSION_SECRET=

# SUPABASE ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES

## Supabase project URL
### Local + Vercel/deployment + GitHub secrets
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-project-id>.supabase.co

## Supabase publishable API key (browser-safe, RLS still applies)
### Local + Vercel/deployment
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_<your-publishable-key>

## Secret API key
### Server-only Data API secret (`sb_secret_…` from Supabase Publishable and secret API keys).
### Next.js uses it for all Archive / Settings / R2 metadata writes.
### Never `NEXT_PUBLIC_`. Not the publishable/anon key. Not Legacy `service_role`. Not `DATABASE_URL`.
### Local + Vercel/deployment + GitHub secrets (same name). Vercel: server env, not Next public.
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=sb_secret_<your-secret-key>


# CLOUDFLARE R2 (Citations / Artifacts uploads)

## Account, bucket, and S3-compatible API token
### Local + Vercel/deployment + GitHub secrets
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_BUCKET=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_ENDPOINT=https://<your-account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com


# GEMINI AI STUDIO (ChiveBot)

## API token from Google AI Studio
### Local + Vercel/deployment + GitHub secrets
### Server-only. Required when FLAG_CHIVEBOT=true
GEMINI_API_KEY=
